**Read:** [Supply chain management for the process industry — Songsong Liu](../sources/Process-Industry-Supply-Chain-Management-Liu.lingua#r_5W74Q34MKEJAWVS30JV4QH01YQ), the whole thesis used as a concrete depth/method comparison; [Enterprise-wide Optimization: A New Frontier in Process Systems Engineering — Grossmann](../sources/Enterprise-wide-Optimization-Grossmann.lingua#r_4XD1X5QN83H40RBMGJVSZY9Y8V), the entire perspective and the full primary literature relevant to the selected problem; [Graduate Supply Chain Planning — MIT 15.762J](../sources/Graduate-Supply-Chain-Planning-MIT.lingua#r_16MZ0PJM4KC10A3D9AYYESBT6P), the complete graduate methods relevant to the question; [Validation of Measurement Procedures that Include Sampling — Eurachem](../sources/Validation-Including-Sampling-Eurachem.lingua#r_0H2SA2SC85XXDYT629N3E3KGXA), the full measurement methods when physical evidence is involved.

Choose a precise unresolved question arising from the integrated system: representing grade and history in a network, detecting a source of receiver disagreement, allocating expiring qualified stock, controlling correlated disruption exposure, proving a recovery limit, or another question whose answer would change understanding of this supply. Define competing explanations and what evidence could distinguish them.

Build a full literature account using primary papers, complete theses/books and technical methods, with actual editions, corrections and rights. Reproduce an important published or source-derived result independently before claiming an extension. Derive the model or experimental design, explain data meaning/uncertainty and compare alternative methods; include cases that could falsify the preferred account.

Carry out sustained original analytic, computational, documentary, empirical or appropriately supervised experimental work. Match claims to that actual scope. Preserve reproducible derivations, code and data references, observation history, numerical/measurement checks, alternative objectives and unresolved knowledge or proprietary-method gaps. Assess how different assumptions change the interpretation.

Produce a substantial scholarly report or thesis-quality investigation, invite independent criticism and revise it. The standard is a defensible contribution with methods and limitations that another investigator can inspect, not a claim to possess all trade secrets or a checklist of finished readings. Connect the resulting knowledge through ordinary shared Records and source links for future readers and continuing revision.

**Continue:** [Demonstrate understanding through a defended and revisable supply system](Explain-and-defend-the-system-you-can-now-understand.lingua#r_4S97V7AJZN9VEMN98BRVKWKGP5).

